# Test 33: dangling else inside a while joins the inner if
RESULT SLR ACCEPTED
RESULT LALR ACCEPTED
RESULT CLR ACCEPTED
TREE CLR: [S while ( [BN a < b] ) [S if ( [BN c < d] ) [S [A x = 1] ;] else [S [A x = 2] ;]]]
TREE SLR: [S while ( [BN a < b] ) [S if ( [BN c < d] ) [S [A x = 1] ;] else [S [A x = 2] ;]]]
